{"job_id":"F-6c54e6b61cb8b35838d9","family_id":"F-6c54e6b61cb8b35838d9","title":"유한책임신탁등기규칙","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011627-266853-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":10,"target_id":"4f62bf06d6a17458d70482d6931a38a3615cbb21ec09d49438a3156615471367","source_hash":"4a9b95411e466be2f3857dcaadd26d7976744b0ac08da7c87b3d489e2dc56d58","text":"有限责任信托注册规则"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011627-266853-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":67,"target_id":"9f4ca0260d49d563253afc76a315116b4a58f54e6fef51404a5e4edf37fcf49e","source_hash":"6cae7dda7287723b8bfbe3d3f111485d377d00073ed2ee65267a9c7a01ec858c","text":"第一条（目的）本规则的目的是规定根据信托法（以下简称“本法”）登记有限责任信托的程序。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011627-266853-ko","scope":"BODY","start":67,"end":167,"target_id":"e1a4fd25e5cfe44b1d5ac36674c986de5eba3854ba0097d68d19bd7bd7f7ec32","source_hash":"92e26711c77efaead94d5a865c714b753a021c4b13969666fcc5ac2c3ac5a5e1","text":"第二条（登记记录的组织）登记记录（指单一有限责任信托的登记信息；以下简称登记记录）应当按照本条例附件一表格每一栏中记录的登记信息，通过计算机信息处理系统进行组织。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011627-266853-ko","scope":"BODY","start":167,"end":384,"target_id":"72f33baa8e9e19bfd7cf11c92c78a65bff6d2f0c239e6e744af728c96853ea1d","source_hash":"30125e3b3f96a2a02edc835c44ab666b648527e358a3eca873187489081e85b1","text":"第三条（受托人等的登记）登记受托人、信托财产管理人或清算受托人时，应当登记其姓名、地址及居民登记号码（法人，指商号、总行或主要行行所在地及法人登记号码）。无居民登记号码的境外人士或外国人，应当登记其外国人登记号码、国内居住报告号码或出生日期。<2024年11月29日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011627-266853-ko","scope":"BODY","start":384,"end":518,"target_id":"6384ab0f12046e573ff9995c1f6aa3ffdf0ac07c316ee28a12f9ccb8e3857e11","source_hash":"d38f34631e1ecea5e447096c4a0fec5a5a5fcc1de0442b09dfb43f56c9123005","text":"第四条（信托管理地变更登记）因信托管理地变更，须依本法第一百二十七条第二款规定在新信托管理地进行登记的，应当在开立登记事由及登记日期一栏中，记明信托管理地变更的事实及变更日期。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011627-266853-ko","scope":"BODY","start":518,"end":598,"target_id":"dbe65dd9eb6f9c9dc2b27bc0b0015bbf6fe3c2ace9617aa3cac6063551f82f24","source_hash":"0d1651526ead03addd82d7ea91ceab2c1b18e2e29c7f697a74d67e4a23902f21","text":"第五条（信托财产管理人登记）登记委任新的受托人或新的信托财产受托人时，应当表示注销有关信托财产管理人的登记。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011627-266853-ko","scope":"BODY","start":598,"end":667,"target_id":"1c6161d5e89d4fd0e5a8a36f56e83c684d17b4ffde87d20611c3b5e916b08cbc","source_hash":"70b4af0d0575ee6d1d413586f070447f73ee77c2728a88a0e6fe43745432e9b6","text":"第六条（有限责任信托终止登记） 登记有限责任信托终止时，应当注明取消有关受托人的登记。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011627-266853-ko","scope":"BODY","start":667,"end":835,"target_id":"b13f81923831ea9e464013e7b0d19f67196d92a72153c08a8e64d0e2a06f9d5b","source_hash":"69ebaff6d32952bbf75b4972064a0941a2f95ca0246080bbea3d9fc5986ff04d","text":"第七条（登记记录的关闭）下列各项的登记应当在杂项栏中登记，登记完毕后，登记记录应当关闭。\n1. 当信托管理地迁至其他管辖区时，需在原信托管理地管辖区的登记处进行变更登记。\n2. 因有限责任信托合并而终止的登记\n3. 清算完成登记\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011627-266853-ko","scope":"BODY","start":835,"end":1024,"target_id":"22b2fcbfa9e8e9b22f733f0d634d49df42c01984c663a52a93c4bb4dc37e7644","source_hash":"4719d7bca115dd55431dd31ae20ddfd6bdac411387096134971382ecdc365ecc","text":"第八条（《商业登记规则》的适用）  关于有限责任信托的登记，除本规则及《商业登记规则》第十四条第一款、第二十八条之二、第三十三条、第四十三条至第五十条、第六十三条及第六十七条至第七十一条另有规定外，《商业登记规则》依必要修改适用，但与事项性质相悖者除外。<2014年10月2日修订；2024年11月29日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011627-266853-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1024,"end":1075,"target_id":"26f6d45a4fdd3c07d65aa508f0bd82148d396d08c90e213a74e858d2d401769e","source_hash":"eb30859cdf799a29b2697da48a9218889defb1edfd79978fea1ca9f60caba385","text":"补充规定 <2414号，2012年5月29日>\n\n该规定自2012年7月26日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011627-266853-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1075,"end":1106,"target_id":"6d361cce236f386d0e1f8dc22179aad858cb4790e1aaa7510e7e522d3a3978f8","source_hash":"3b6e02acece99aeaea627651620438a08bb9dd21f236ecbb4a99ab4aecd3f704","text":"补充规定（商业登记规则）<2014年10月2日第2560号>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011627-266853-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1106,"end":1144,"target_id":"726977fced66cb71a10ea4e9ed9d893c35ef3faadd3aacd81f4794fd300e5bb4","source_hash":"0b4f770c29a806979b42e773c7442307855a87fdf0b7b61ef42f389a64df5442","text":"第一条（生效日期）本规则自2014年11月21日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011627-266853-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1144,"end":1152,"target_id":"8ec6942056d436fe1b31f025e0bcbe3d499995697d5b1302bdbed8383ba6cbda","source_hash":"1fa2d78222cc5f3a7b268ba3015a524a8e57a9355a8b17e0ae4253566ef34323","text":"第 2 条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011627-266853-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1152,"end":1212,"target_id":"d589721e43f9020e7f15e780d57ddfc5be4e49b7bc2871278063347564c49b03","source_hash":"991ec4ced4ed3a5cd632316b25a0e26b5009caeeb01db650d376125a3aef9ee4","text":"第三条（其他规则的修改）①至③ 省略\n\n  4. 有限责任信托登记规则部分修改如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011627-266853-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1212,"end":1358,"target_id":"da411636adb3f7234221dde8384801e6a4efc49566a85d8b121a8b2437226381","source_hash":"5b870a2bfc9408e4187196aad4b50852d129ce59d49ec85c46bddd6c4136fd1f","text":"  第八条中，“《商业登记规则》第十五条、第三十五条、第四十五条至第五十二条、第五十七条和第六十一条至第六十六条”应改为“《商业登记规则》第十四条第一款、第三十三款、第四十三条至第五十条、第六十三款和第六十七条至第七十一款”。\n\n  省略⑤至⑧\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011627-266853-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1358,"end":1366,"target_id":"34a9766008f9f4e82b0df3a1678f4acc40b84fca7216aed82d3087730ac3cb36","source_hash":"bc28291f8a8368cab289540ec155c57b21b6d38387b73664ba08b936ee269006","text":"第 4 条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00017","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011627-266853-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1366,"end":1398,"target_id":"227005760cca0dcc3b8b64fffa4e8d6c0144d2095963c689e316f3641fb286c2","source_hash":"f264701d8a02a5d9d6e5cbe86b5227d9e5e3d472b6bb4c7af9c0887989d74362","text":"补充规定（商业登记规则）<2024年11月29日第3170号>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00018","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011627-266853-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1398,"end":1443,"target_id":"8b0a1e325a4c38cf1afa442f22ec1fa9156771b6acb74889385202ecdfd25711","source_hash":"2cdaf70f9d12faddf55d88026e2b4e0a40f36820799dee1944616195406de56d","text":"第一条（生效日期）本规则自2025年1月31日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00019","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011627-266853-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1443,"end":1460,"target_id":"d71cdb0859ea42f888723f7e755ea213af735af3025a9190a540b2be3a4616f4","source_hash":"d9985315e81c5ba7d5516a248b6bd3f949098433ce3c6da60edc74f7499d0a05","text":"省略第2至7条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00020","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011627-266853-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1460,"end":1514,"target_id":"58e719f057c5fb7a991e1705329de39bf2aae45fb1d6e1a4dcdc10d2512e28b1","source_hash":"ee9ffd5c84475ee0748d74b70299cd072d11586deff6e40ec551020cd8965ed7","text":"第八条（其他规则的修改）① 已省略\n\n  ② 有限责任信托登记规则部分修改如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00021","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011627-266853-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1514,"end":1561,"target_id":"ee4d5f4d48a359ec0c440f82329125747d2988d354953aa2e89bc7ee812651fc","source_hash":"cdaef314e6f7372bd470e65fd08cbb8bd484e9ca45ce6ae82387ba0efeaed285","text":"  在第三条后半部分，“that”应改为“that外国人登记号码、国内居住报告号码或”。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00022","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011627-266853-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1561,"end":1633,"target_id":"4f352585593c6142090f4c5633960d7c514f5f99085f2e4c46cb9981c5c19356","source_hash":"b221a53982ac600fce18c27d600348c1161846d171a02685865763123bb2a780","text":"  第八条中的“商业登记规则第十四条第一款”应改为“商业登记规则第十四条第一款和第二十八条之二”。\n\n有限责任信托登记记录\n"},{"id":"A37256-zh-00001","doc":"A37256","law_id":"kr-011627-266853-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2716958","source_hash":"0b5b2f67507fa2d4f2c6e6ef3f672a2b26bbdf8fa83e3c5e5f3be06d70c1bea1","text":"[附件表格1] 有限责任信托登记记录"},{"id":"A37256-zh-00002","doc":"A37256","law_id":"kr-011627-266853-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2716959","source_hash":"1a15ea79f58c34c38784825317e0ac3913aed4d01575a989b3438ecea2764bd6","text":"注册号"},{"id":"A37256-zh-00003","doc":"A37256","law_id":"kr-011627-266853-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2716962","source_hash":"87f9cfb7e151274e8ffec247d4979af0905d3d867630ac99cbbf899d52e7d71f","text":"信任管理处理站点"},{"id":"A37256-zh-00004","doc":"A37256","law_id":"kr-011627-266853-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2716965","source_hash":"d839cfbf3c190a3ee1cc405234d3515793c4541e9ddcb0ff8c794fa962584867","text":"关于受托人等的事项"},{"id":"A37256-zh-00005","doc":"A37256","law_id":"kr-011627-266853-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2716966","source_hash":"91aa6c742e11e137b92ab4fa41bb2a1915b6ef1e9db37e8de6334e00c2914b50","text":"其他详情"},{"id":"A37256-zh-00006","doc":"A37256","law_id":"kr-011627-266853-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2716967","source_hash":"ee4288359bffd76cb86bdef937fb2bc17c47e40e5f370bd1c1253f6ffa986906","text":"生效日期"},{"id":"A37256-zh-00007","doc":"A37256","law_id":"kr-011627-266853-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2716968","source_hash":"e5b15de6f689c2e2f0f141cbaf771d765f00254a8e34d9d4499d0b3df60a6bab","text":"注册记录开启原因及日期"}]}